 function sscPage(rendered,base){
      if(!rendered.mock)return null;
      const path='ssc.html',url=base+path,title='SSC – Student Society Center | SALU Community',desc='SSC (Student Society Center) at SALU: student societies, events, the co-curricular calendar and how to get involved in campus life at Shah Abdul Latif University, Khairpur.';
      const main=`<section id="v-ssc" class="view on">
<div class="quiz-hero jp-test-hero"><span class="pill">SSC</span><h1>Student Society Center</h1><p class="sub">SSC stands for Student Society Center. It is the place where SALU students find their society, build skills and make campus life count.</p></div>

<div class="ssc-box"><h2>What is the SSC?</h2>
<p>University is more than classes. The Student Society Center brings students together around their interests, so that every student can find a group to learn with, lead in and enjoy campus life with. The SALU Prospectus 2027 lists a Student Society Center among the university's extension services, and the Directorate of Student Affairs encourages and supports students in organising academic events, cultural programs, sports activities and community service.</p>
<p>The center coordinates around 45 active student societies across academic, cultural, literary, social and community-development areas, and student activities are supported by sports facilities, a library and tennis courts.</p>
<p>This page is the SALU Community guide to that side of university life: what student societies do, which events to look forward to and how you can get involved.</p></div>

<h2 class="ssc-h">Leadership</h2>
<div class="ssc-lead">
<div class="ssc-person ssc-vc"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Meritorious Prof. Dr. Muhammad Yousuf Khushk" width="120" height="120"><div><span class="ssc-role">Message from the Vice Chancellor</span><h3>Meritorious Prof. Dr. Muhammad Yousuf Khushk</h3><small>Vice Chancellor, Shah Abdul Latif University, Khairpur</small><p>Dear students, welcome to Shah Abdul Latif University, Khairpur.</p><p>A university is a place where knowledge grows, but character is built through the experiences we share outside the classroom as well. Our student societies give you the chance to lead, to collaborate, to speak, to create and to serve.</p><p>I encourage every student to find a society that matches their interest, to take part with honesty and discipline, and to represent SALU with pride. May the Student Society Center help you turn your talent into confidence and your ideas into action.</p><p>I wish you the very best in your studies and in your future.</p></div></div>
<div class="ssc-person"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Dr. Ali Raza Lashari" width="120" height="120"><div><span class="ssc-role">Coordinator</span><h3>Dr. Ali Raza Lashari</h3><small>Coordinator, Student Society Center</small><p>Leads the Student Society Center and coordinates the student societies and their activities, under the vision and direction of the university administration.</p></div></div>
</div>

<h2 class="ssc-h">Events and announcements</h2>
<div id="sscEvents" class="ssc-events"><p class="ssc-small">Loading events…</p></div>
<script src="salu-ssc.js" defer><\/script>

<h2 class="ssc-h">What the SSC is for</h2>
<div class="ssc-grid">
<div class="ssc-card"><b>Find your society</b><p>Literary, sports, arts, technology or community service. Meet students who share your interest and learn from seniors.</p></div>
<div class="ssc-card"><b>Events and competitions</b><p>Debates, quizzes, exhibitions, sports weeks and cultural programs where you can take part, perform or help organise.</p></div>
<div class="ssc-card"><b>Leadership and teamwork</b><p>Planning an event teaches budgeting, communication and leading a team, skills that no exam paper can measure.</p></div>
<div class="ssc-card"><b>Workshops and skills</b><p>Public speaking, writing, design, coding and entrepreneurship sessions that add to your degree and your CV.</p></div>
<div class="ssc-card"><b>Community service</b><p>Tree plantation, blood donation, help for flood-affected people and seminars on local issues. Societies help students give back.</p></div>
<div class="ssc-card"><b>A voice for students</b><p>Ideas and concerns from students reach the right people through representatives and the Directorate of Student Affairs.</p></div>
</div>

<h2 class="ssc-h">Areas students organise</h2>
<div class="ssc-chips"><span>Literature and Debate</span><span>Sports and Fitness</span><span>Arts and Culture</span><span>Technology and Computing</span><span>Science and Research</span><span>Entrepreneurship</span><span>Media and Photography</span><span>Community Service</span></div>
<p class="ssc-small">These are the kinds of activities students typically organise at a university. Which societies are active in your department can change each year, so ask your department representative or the Directorate of Student Affairs.</p>

<h2 class="ssc-h">Co-curricular calendar 2027</h2>
<p class="ssc-small">Tentative calendar of co-curricular activities from the SALU Prospectus 2027. Dates are announced by the university during the year.</p>
<div class="ssc-cal">
<div><b>January</b><span>Orientation for New Session</span></div>
<div><b>February</b><span>Students' Week</span></div>
<div><b>March</b><span>Tree Plantation Day</span></div>
<div><b>April</b><span>Art Exhibition</span></div>
<div><b>May</b><span>Book Fair</span></div>
<div><b>August</b><span>Independence Day Celebration</span></div>
<div><b>September</b><span>Latif Day</span></div>
<div><b>October</b><span>World Teachers' Day</span></div>
<div><b>November</b><span>International Students' Day</span></div>
<div><b>December</b><span>Farewell at Departments</span></div>
</div>
<p class="ssc-small">Every year SALU also arranges cultural and national days, a flower exhibition, a scientific exhibition, an entrepreneurship mela, blood donation camps and seminars on community issues.</p>

<h2 class="ssc-h">How to get involved</h2>
<ol class="ssc-steps">
<li><b>Follow the calendar and announcements.</b> Events and notices appear on the <a href="announcements.html">Announcements</a> page.</li>
<li><b>Talk to your department representative.</b> They know which activities are running in your department. You can also <a href="department-representative.html">join the SALU Community team</a>.</li>
<li><b>Visit the Directorate of Student Affairs.</b> It supports student activities, counselling and welfare, and is the official office for society matters on campus.</li>
<li><b>Start small.</b> Volunteer at one event, then take on a role. Most society leaders began exactly that way.</li>
</ol>
<p class="sp-team-join"><a class="btn" href="department-representative.html">Join our team</a> <a class="btn alt" href="our-team.html">Meet the team</a> <button type="button" class="btn alt" onclick="var b=document.getElementById('saluAiBtn');if(b)b.click();">Ask the AI Assistant</button></p>
<p class="ssc-small ssc-note">SALU Community is an independent student platform. Official rules and registration of societies are handled by Shah Abdul Latif University's Directorate of Student Affairs. Please confirm details with them.</p>
</section>`;
      return {path,type:'ssc',title:'SSC – Student Society Center',url,html:prepareDoc(rendered.mock,{title,desc,url,hubPage:'ssc',openTest:'',main,crumbs:[['Home',base],['SSC',url]],searchLabel:['Search the website','Search the website']})};
     }
